    ((-768 : ℝ) * hk thF0 0) * (w * Zax w * Eax w * (Pax w)⁻¹) +
    ((196608 : ℝ) * hk thF0 0 * π * π⁻¹) * (w * Zax w * Uax w * Uax w * (Pax w)⁻¹ * (Pax w)⁻¹) +
